      "role": "ember keeper",
      "persona": "Quick and clipped, she speaks softly as if the nest could overhear. She is guarding something and hates being asked what.",
      "knowledge": [
        "The nest cooled because the Wyrm stopped feeding the slag-fire, not because it left.",
